    {
      "id": "676b9961-5e04-4880-9fd0-d6de36e5e609",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe que puesto aparece quando a ação já está resolvida.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 9,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "00dd92a2-c3ac-4f67-a6b3-832c53e2feb4",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>puesto</strong> é o particípio irregular de <strong>poner</strong>.</p><p>Ele funciona quando algo já foi colocado, ajustado ou deixado pronto.</p><p>Em <strong>Ya he puesto el móvil en silencio.</strong>, <strong>ya</strong> reforça que a ação já está resolvida.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "401e8186-c21a-4d9b-86f1-75ce75192a1b",
      "title": "Passe pelas quatro frases e observe em que tipo de situação cada uma pode aparecer no seu dia.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 10,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "637262c5-7641-45ad-bbe0-a8b9056eea96",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Hoy he hecho la compra.</strong></p><p>Útil para avisar que uma tarefa prática do dia já ficou pronta.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/eac74d726f254def8421f33fc9b42442_l06b01-hoy-he-hecho-la-compra-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099557&Signature=J1o1G7oU~X5EPbDASGKaAhjVklUlrtcJ9~~~ceLdNWhhMH4ZHTuyULVFgZQzCJ0dTWHhav1bnkNZiAE2JWBGop0oo~Azh8OSGmawKGMQW6Wvd0vyBM5aF9s6ctoizYB-B5JCBeudxm~Eowt4KSbKv7nckbN1c0FID1FPO0SD-3wwYSShiLImskmJYH~vH6vBjfnZMyyKgXEHdMLGTpcq32x7147nZNd-QSh6hRWQ7kMvJvHT9jbRmh9WbqCMgg5y6c5k6QQg0AmowYvRX95moWXZWHlM~lArAo0tF0n~zwnCNy49P~M9Qp10OhB7cmT5x7FW-CKv6uYN9nWC2cEa8A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "272bf33d-d67d-4d15-8a92-a8e76447fa34",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Hoy he visto a Laura en el café.</strong></p><p>Serve para comentar um encontro casual que aconteceu hoje.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8f3abb0cb02246dc938fca049dafba9a_l06b03-hoy-he-visto-a-laura-en-el-cafe-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099557&Signature=OnAplXMHLwjumbjnw1xXpCQBe2Ml6XMgCGOHiEVWdBh4hnzdQOZjWGYjDqtwaKV2fbf0vglJB7-~N-SK744RVBGk0NDUIEH2bQBfFxvnUcLNwOX26Rf93bEXGTXymojPNdXtsXtlySiVgjtxZSFNY8bPsoYiIHeRSRssFzPf4hPDCDNHeKq6DjKCWPLVXG5Y7TqHLSLB8bye-WwECRjuPS7~LCIOUz5MzpEEK1n1cFPCqOYMtTomiiSh5DlINBnOcWTvQcE0JRw9eiyHSeAglRc2zDSvQrmYiaX2X8-J-OW6WYp8hhuH2MKFp6EHjhIu8509czCUBaoquxBt6~BJrA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "0063aabc-1d76-47e2-8880-df2314a7082b",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Luego he vuelto a casa.</strong></p><p>Ajuda a ordenar um relato do dia quando você já voltou para casa.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7566a523ed6d4a3fb134ba703cd18a6c_l06b05-luego-he-vuelto-a-casa-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099557&Signature=bG-3aVafmD761EQzOpeFGXXgwS3dwoLiK5tGQRn5pH6WWEn9~wWWOGCFKvBbLJbZjhK~bRzTrGySEXkmeEFP9hKrDn17nfB53DsdWlDY7lm5rp53arTKfNht7HIPyrgtrG0c~vXR3R1O2Z5LdBfn4VJ5byEZ7UYXm7ubOXLsJdiQG1noJBHDirg9v0IEIpltEZlNIiPwKd53zOe2P7X8vY~l7GmDvohpPck37dRX-E0YVyfluV-ux2kmWHh9opO8y-mhBEtcywA7cpmzJtH5PDcTTyQxGpYqcHPWrnPsynQsJkdYOX5T0SSan-xRFYT1QdFWdzLMcHyuuXwf6pG81g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "1240ee08-72d5-4191-a30a-5dc35dd55421",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Ya he puesto el móvil en silencio.</strong></p><p>Fecha a aula com uma frase útil antes de reunião, aula ou conversa importante.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
